From feat/multirealm-playerbots-release (5b9020e80, e1740be09), without its test runner,
.env example and build scripts (the runner held local passwords):
- AscensionWildcard::ApplyArchetypeBuild sets a whole build for one specialization
  (primary stat, ranks the level allows) and records the build id; Save takes a spec.
- AscensionWarcraftReborn::ForgetClassSpellsAbove also forgets the twin copy (+1100000)
  and uses the higher of SpellLevel/BaseLevel. Prestige resets use it too.
- AscensionMysticEnchant::RecommendEnchants picks up to seven fitting enchants; GuideFits
  is public for it.

